WEBVTT

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.580
Hola a todos, femininos, to Tiny Desk.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.900
It's hard to put into words how much

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.540
the huge honor is to be here.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:04.260
And this amazing place and play with this wonderful musician,

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:11.870
started with Master Gonzalo Rubelcava on the piano.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:18.430
And we have Kush Abadi on the drums

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:25.870
and Pavlominares on the bass.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.310
And even more special is to be able to present this beautiful

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:35.030
music from my latest, Blue Nut Release, which is called Feeling.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:42.110
I'm feeling is a musical movement that happened in Cuba during the 40s and 60s, where musicians

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:49.710
were very inspired by jazz, amboletos, and South American literature.

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:54.510
And most of the music from our latest album is from that time period.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:59.510
The first thing that we play is one called Dimasi de Sto, tell me if it's you.

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:04.510
It's one of tune from one of the most prominent figures from that time.

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:07.510
His name is José Antonio Mendez.

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:12.510
And we're going to continue with another beautiful song by Frank Dominguez.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:15.510
This is called Imaginus Images.

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:22.510
And it's a love song that talks about somebody that meets their true love.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:25.710
but they leave them way too fast.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:30.190
And this song is about the memories that the person lives behind

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:35.470
and the empty feelings, empty spaces that are created from that

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:39.630
moment. This is also an arrangement by Gonzalo

00:05:39.630 --> 00:06:26.340
and this is called Immaculance.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:09:37.500
And thank you. So the last two songs that we're going to play,

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:42.140
this one is called Leader Church, it's a song that was made,

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:46.140
was written by her metal pasquelle, who has transitioned not too long ago.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:51.140
And it was made famous by a famous myelave's album, Life Evil.

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:54.140
And this is also an arrangement by Gonzalo.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:57.140
And after that, we're going to finish with a renal of mine from my previous

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:01.140
Blue Note release, which is called Echoes of the Inner Prophet.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:05.140
And the name of the song is unconscious whisper.
